name sankey
category Package
revision 61874
shortdesc Draw Sankey diagrams with TikZ
longdesc This package provides macros and an environment for creating
longdesc Sankey diagrams, i.e. flow diagrams in which the width of the
longdesc arrows is proportional to the flow rate.
